A. Commit message:
ice: Fix deinitializing VF in error path for older kernel version

B. Change summary:
Moved the removal of VFs from the snapshot PF-VF mailbox list to ice_free_vf_entries() to prevent list corruption when ice_ena_vfs() fails after calling ice_create_vf_entries(). This ensures that VFs are properly removed from the list even in error paths.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

D. Fixed Code:
